# Keep the build context small: the images only COPY the Go module (go.mod, go.sum, cmd/, internal/), the
# analyzer project, web/ and docker/nginx.conf.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
!analyzer/
!web/
!docker/nginx.conf
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*_test.go
analyzer/.venv
analyzer/tests
web/node_modules
web/dist
